    "demo_email": "Subject: Summer 2026 AI/Robotics Research Exchange — NTU Singapore (UG 2023 only)\n\nDear OGE Team,\n\nWe are pleased to announce that NTU Singapore has confirmed 5 seats for Plaksha students in their Summer 2026 AI and Robotics Research Exchange Programme (July 1 – August 31, 2026).\n\nEligibility: Open exclusively to UG 2023 batch students. Minimum CGPA 7.5 required. Students must not have any active backlogs.\n\nFunding: Plaksha will cover the programme fee (SGD 1,200). Students are responsible for travel and accommodation (~SGD 1,800/month). Limited need-based travel grants available — apply separately via the scholarship office.\n\nApplication deadline: June 15, 2026. Please submit the nomination list to partners@ntu.edu.sg by June 20, 2026.\n\nRequired documents: CV/resume, statement of purpose (500 words), unofficial transcript.\n\nApproval process: As per standard procedure, all nominations must be cleared by OAA (no backlogs), UG Academics (CGPA verification), and reviewed by the relevant Program Chair before OGE submits to NTU. Dean approval required for final nomination.\n\nFor queries contact: oge@plaksha.edu.in\n\nBest,\nOGE Team"
